WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Welcome to the demo of my C++ Tic-Tac-Toe game running in the terminal.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Here, Player X and Player O take turns entering board coordinates to make their moves.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:35.000
The program validates each move to prevent overwriting existing cells.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Finally, the game checks for a winning line or a draw and displays the result.